# Commands the exec-api server is allowed to run.
# One command name per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# WARNING: the allowlist only checks the top-level binary. Args are passed
# through unfiltered, so any binary that can spawn other binaries is a full
# bypass of this allowlist. Do NOT add commands like:
#   find (-exec), xargs, awk (system()), make, git (-c, aliases, hooks),
#   python/node/perl/ruby and other interpreters, vim/less/man (!cmd shell-out),
#   ssh (ProxyCommand), tar (--use-compress-program), env, nice, time.
# See the "Allowlist hazards" section in README.md.
cat
ls
echo
date
grep
